<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39530" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαθ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>set upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					78
				</span></i>
			: abs., (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίμακι</span>) ibid.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ ἐν ἅρματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
				</span></i>
			
			<i>4 Ki..</i><i><span class="en">
				10.16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπλοις ἀφανῶς ἐ. τὸ στρατιωτικόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					18.3.1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φυλακὴν ἐπεκαθίσαντο</span>
			<i>had</i> a guard <i>set</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.130
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικαθίσταντο</span> Poppo).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. Intr., <i>sit
			upon</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πειθώ τις ἐπεκάθιζεν ἐπὶ τοῖς χείλεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					94.5
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρχησίοις ἐ</span>. <i>light upon</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.10.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>sit</i>
			<i>down against, besiege</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.61.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
